Command Code protocol adapter
=============================

The Command Code request, identity and stream adapters were implemented with
reference to learningdog1/CommandCodeGo-manager v0.2.10, commit
bdbd68ef47d42e7ffdb9a7278c9eb219f42f0ff7.
https://github.com/learningdog1/CommandCodeGo-manager

That project's protocol implementation derives from MAXeaglet/commandcode-proxy,
commit 9bdfafcb17ad0417eaf8600e830109d11084e6d7.
https://github.com/MAXeaglet/commandcode-proxy

